# Pairs with NoLostWrite. Settling the gap resumes at the head instead of
# rewinding to the retained point, skipping writes the receiver never got.
MODULE: NoLostWriteSettleSkipsRewind
TARGET: NoLostWrite
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a settled gap resumes at the head without rewinding
PERTURBS: Settle

--- FIND
    /\ cursor' = retainFrom
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the settle does not rewind.
    /\ cursor' = head
--- END